        "emitting it, so nothing in the generator can turn it into its element type.",
        "The function that looked like the place, goDescFor, renders the description a",
        "diagnostic prints; removing its slice prefix changes an error message and",
        "nothing else, which the probe confirmed by passing unchanged.",
